@startuml
' Overview of key process flows: the computable source of the figure that
' workflow.png drew by hand. The IG Publisher renders it to workflow.svg
' ({% include workflow.svg %}).
'
' Every node links to the concept it stands for:
'   - systems to this IG's actors (system-actors.html, CodeSystem IPS.HAJJ.ACTOR),
'     each with the SMART reference architecture (smart-ra) actor it realises
'     (canonical http://smart.who.int/ra/ActorDefinition/<id>);
'   - people to this IG's personas (personas.html);
'   - WHO GDHCN to the IPS-PILGRIMAGE Trust Domain in the GDHCN Trust IG.
' Every numbered flow links to its moment of the pilgrim's journey (P0-P5 in
' the journeys viewer), and its label to the transaction that specifies it
' (CodeSystem IPS.HAJJ.TRANSACTION).
'
' Step -> journey moment -> transaction:
'   1 -> P1 health check and consent -> consent-wallet
'   2 -> P2 summary signed           -> doc-sign
'   3 -> P3 taken ill in Mina        -> (shows the QR code)
'   4 -> P4 scanned and checked      -> shl-get-manifest
'   5 -> P5 record read and treated  -> doc-get
'   A -> P0 keys and codes shared    -> keys-put
'   B -> P4 scanned and checked      -> keys-get
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam svgDimensionStyle false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4472C4
skinparam ArrowFontColor #2F5597
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderStyle dashed
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4472C4
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #548235
}

title Overview of key process flows

actor "Pilgrim" as pilgrim [[personas.html{Persona: Pilgrim (IPS.HAJJ.ACTOR#pilgrim)}]]

rectangle "Home Country" as home #F3F7FC;line:4472C4;text:2F5597 {
  node "Origin Country Health Wallet\n<size:10>smart-ra: Point-of-Service System</size>" as ochw [[system-actors.html#ochw{Origin Country Health Wallet (IPS.HAJJ.ACTOR#ochw); smart-ra: http://smart.who.int/ra/ActorDefinition/PointOfServiceSystem}]]
  node "Origin Country HIE\n<size:10>smart-ra: Interoperability Layer, Shared Health Record</size>" as ochie [[system-actors.html#ochie{Origin Country HIE (IPS.HAJJ.ACTOR#ochie); smart-ra: http://smart.who.int/ra/ActorDefinition/InteroperabilityLayer and http://smart.who.int/ra/ActorDefinition/SharedHealthRecord}]]
}

rectangle "KSA" as ksa #F3F7FC;line:4472C4;text:2F5597 {
  actor "Host Country\nHealth Worker" as hw [[personas.html{Persona: Host Country Health Worker}]]
  node "Host Country EMR\n<size:10>smart-ra: Point-of-Service System</size>" as hcemr [[system-actors.html#hcemr{Host Country EMR (IPS.HAJJ.ACTOR#hcemr); smart-ra: http://smart.who.int/ra/ActorDefinition/PointOfServiceSystem}]]
}

cloud "WHO GDHCN\n<size:10>Trust Domain IPS-PILGRIMAGE</size>" as gdhcn [[http://smart.who.int/trust/Binary-TrustDomain-IPS-PILGRIMAGE.html{WHO GDHCN: the IPS-PILGRIMAGE Trust Domain}]] #F4F9F1;line:548235;text:548235

pilgrim --> ochw : <b>[[en/smart-ips-pilgrimage/journeys/smart-ips-pilgrimage/p1-health-check-and-consent/{P1: Health check and consent} 1]]</b> Pilgrim configures access to IPS\nvia QR code on national health wallet\n<size:10>consent-wallet</size>
ochw --> ochie : <b>[[en/smart-ips-pilgrimage/journeys/smart-ips-pilgrimage/p2-summary-signed/{P2: Summary signed} 2]]</b> IPS generated from patient\ncare history in Home Country\n<size:10>doc-sign</size>
pilgrim --> hw : <b>[[en/smart-ips-pilgrimage/journeys/smart-ips-pilgrimage/p3-taken-ill-in-mina/{P3: Taken ill in Mina} 3]]</b> Pilgrim seeks care and shows\nIPS QR code to health worker
hw --> hcemr : <b>[[en/smart-ips-pilgrimage/journeys/smart-ips-pilgrimage/p4-scanned-and-checked/{P4: Scanned and checked} 4]]</b> Health worker scans IPS\nQR code in their EMR\n<size:10>shl-get-manifest</size>
ochie --> hcemr : <b>[[en/smart-ips-pilgrimage/journeys/smart-ips-pilgrimage/p5-record-read-and-treated/{P5: Record read and treated} 5]]</b> EMR retrieves IPS\nfrom Home Country HIE\n<size:10>doc-get</size>
ochie -[#548235]-> gdhcn : <color:#548235><b>[[en/smart-ips-pilgrimage/journeys/smart-ips-pilgrimage/p0-keys-and-codes-shared/{P0: Keys and codes shared} A]]</b> IPS verification keys\n<color:#548235>published to GDHCN\n<size:10><color:#548235>keys-put</color></size>
gdhcn -[#548235]-> hcemr : <color:#548235><b>[[en/smart-ips-pilgrimage/journeys/smart-ips-pilgrimage/p4-scanned-and-checked/{P4: Scanned and checked} B]]</b> Verification keys retrieved by EMR\n<color:#548235>to ensure provenance of IPS\n<size:10><color:#548235>keys-get</color></size>

legend right
  <b>Links</b>: each box opens its actor or persona in this guide;
  each numbered flow opens its moment of the pilgrim's journey.
  Transaction codes are from [[CodeSystem-IPS.HAJJ.TRANSACTION.html IPS.HAJJ.TRANSACTION]];
  systems are mapped to the [[https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/ SMART reference architecture]] actors.
endlegend
@enduml
